        "quote": "“Dwelling unit” means a structure or the part of a structure that is used as a home, residence or sleeping place by one person who maintains a household or by two or more persons who maintain a common household.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:0#text",
