        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "92062a8f-3a59-5224-8612-2de6a4d30298",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 279,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:1",
          "start": 212
        },
        "quote": "“Good faith” means honesty in fact in the conduct of a transaction.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "f84edae4-5f8c-5a43-acb7-b37e586a0910",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 458,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:2",
          "start": 280
        },
        "quote": "“Good standing” means that a tenant is not in arrears in the payment of rent and is in compliance with the duties of a tenant enumerated in K.S.A. 58-2555 and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "95e65fd4-cccb-589b-a59d-cb312a8b5abe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 559,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:3",
          "start": 459
        },
        "quote": "“Landlord” means the owner or lessor of a dwelling unit or the building of which the unit is a part.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "7b502ee9-604b-5ffe-882a-6b81420935c4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 705,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:4",
          "start": 560
        },
        "quote": "“Rental agreement” means all agreements, written or oral, embodying the terms and conditions concerning the use and occupancy of a dwelling unit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "373dab88-d54f-53e8-a70c-a1d76b49fbfb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 906,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:5",
          "start": 706
        },
        "quote": "“Retaliate” or “retaliatory action” shall include but not be limited to any of the following actions by a landlord when such actions penalize a tenant because of an action identified in TMC 9.25.030 :",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "43a25b75-3cce-533f-ab73-82d9e2abc101",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1002,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:6",
          "start": 907
        },
        "quote": "(1) Commencement of any action or proceeding to recover possession of a dwelling from a tenant;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "128635e1-06ba-53bc-bbf5-604523b94f27",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1027,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:7",
          "start": 1003
        },
        "quote": "(2) Increasing the rent;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "43064883-7426-5134-8245-9153a8d686e9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1176,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:8",
          "start": 1028
        },
        "quote": "(3) Reduction of services required to be provided by the landlord pursuant to the rental agreement and/or K.S.A. 58-2553 and amendments thereto; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "4b62c299-3726-5e9d-87d1-737fa78036d6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1321,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:9",
          "start": 1177
        },
        "quote": "(4) Harassing entry or repeated demands for entry of the tenant’s dwelling unit by the landlord in violation of K.S.A. 58-2557 and/or 58-2571(b)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.020 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "3b3b040a-4df9-571b-b667-478b2211ba02",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
