          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:10",
          "start": 1322
        },
        "quote": "“Tenant” means a person entitled under a rental agreement to occupy a dwelling unit. (Ord. 20488 § 2, 5-14-24.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.020:block:10#text",
